<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00454/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一把高约0.75m的实木椅子，任何<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">人</span>生物坐在其上时均会不可避免的（以头朝下的姿势）摔倒在地。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-█，Dr.4826的办公室。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被永久保存在Site-█，Dr.4826的办公室内。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>我就不信邪了，██的，我堂堂七尺男儿还坐不上去一把椅子？——Dr.4826<br />
兄弟们，你们要是想我就多来医院看看我，哎呦&#8230;我的脑袋&#8230;——Dr.4826<br />
阿巴阿巴阿巴阿巴阿巴阿巴——Dr.4826</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00454" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00454" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00454-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ngc-4826" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6285237); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6285237&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607221564" alt="NGC-4826" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6285237)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ngc-4826" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6285237); return false;">NGC-4826</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1604823683 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">08 Nov 2020 08:21</span></p>
